        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg inquired who decides the issue of unconscionability."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ac1a5cdb9cb565291af52a2f1256869f7e08ace48bc91247d82f881f5da18759",
