            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor clarified the distinction between \u201cmaking\u201d (e.g., fees) and unconscionability (e.g., discovery)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ac1a5cdb9cb565291af52a2f1256869f7e08ace48bc91247d82f881f5da18759",
